    "collapsible_tabs_KzCFt7": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "item_B9pRyM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "Do you deliver all over India? ",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Currently, we only deliver books all over India. </p><p>Delivery is free within Mumbai, Thane, Navi Mumbai, and Mira-Bhayander. </p><p>Outside Mumbai: There is an additional delivery charge for Book Library deliveries outside Mumbai. </p><p>(Toy Library is only operating in Mumbai as of now) </p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_WXzefN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How does the Library Subscription work?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Step 1: 📚🧸You can subscribe to any plan from our website. </p><p>Step 2: 📲Download the neOwn app to select your books or toys. </p><p>Step 3: 📦Books/toys will be delivered and the pickup and exchange will happen after maximum 30 days</p><p>Step 4: 🔁Finally you return and repeat the same for all the following months of your subscription!</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_m68hHg": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How can I select my books/toys? ",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Once you have subscribed, you can download our app📲 from which you can select the books or toys 📚🧸</p><p>You can select any books/toys of your choice, and in case you are not sure what to pick we have a book expert in-house who can help you out if needed 💖</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_VG9bq9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "header": "How to download the neOwn app? ",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>📲 neOwn App Link: </p><p>🔗 Android: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.neown\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.neown</span></a> </p><p>🔗 Apple: <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/in/app/neown/id6483860525\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">https://apps.apple.com/in/app/neown/id6483860525</span></a> </p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
