          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "header": "How many books & toys can I get in the subscription?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Our Library Plans are as follows: </p><p><strong>Subscription Type</strong></p><p><strong>Number of items per month </strong></p><p>Book Library (1 child)</p><p>5 books per month</p><p>Book Library (2 siblings)</p><p>3+3 books per month </p><p>OR 5+5 books per month</p><p>Toy + Book Combo</p><p>3 toys + 2 books per month</p><p>Toy Library</p><p>4 toys per month</p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_HiA39k": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "header": "Can I see your collection before subscribing? What kind of books & toys do you have?",
            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p>Yes, you can see our collections here: </p><p>Book Collection: </p><p>Toy Collection: </p><p>We keep a very wide variety of fiction books for children between the ages of 0-15 years, and we also have a lot of non-fiction and educational books for children between the ages of 0-15 years. </p><p>We have wide range of premium toys for children between the ages of 6 months - 8 years. This includes STEM toys, Montessori toys, developmental toys, toys for pure fun, and more! </p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
