            "text_size": "h5",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeujWVZn90wu5_RieGkzYLLFISGiUV7JhBArfapKE2EtaKrCA/viewform?usp=sf_link\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeujWVZn90wu5_RieGkzYLLFISGiUV7JhBArfapKE2EtaKrCA/viewform?usp=sf_link\">Step 1: Register by filling this form: </a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeujWVZn90wu5_RieGkzYLLFISGiUV7JhBArfapKE2EtaKrCA/viewform?usp=sf_link\" title=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeujWVZn90wu5_RieGkzYLLFISGiUV7JhBArfapKE2EtaKrCA/viewform?usp=sf_link\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeujWVZn90wu5_RieGkzYLLFISGiUV7JhBArfapKE2EtaKrCA/viewform?usp=sf_link</a></p><p>Step 2: Request to join the WhatsApp Group (we will approve the request 2-5 days before the upcoming challenge) </p><p>Step 3: Read the Challenge Instructions which will be sent on the WhatsApp Group 1 day before the challenge </p><p>Step 4: Participate in the Reading Challenge! </p><p>Step 5: Win Certificates & Badges upon successful completion of the challenge </p>",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
